WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.643
The phrase data type is often used too broadly In
this course we

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:11.655
separate four layers Data organization describes the
form of the dataset

00:00:12.578 --> 00:00:18.328
Measurement scale describes the meaning of one
variable Numeric behavior asks whether

00:00:18.341 --> 00:00:24.355
a quantitative concept comes from counting or
measuring Technical representation describes

00:00:24.381 --> 00:00:29.898
how software stores the value A single variable can
have an answer at

00:00:29.924 --> 00:00:33.095
several layers and those answers are not
interchangeable
